      "message": "Hi, Thiébaud Weksteen\n\nThis change breaks our db845c `android-latest-release` based builds, I see it\u0027s mentioned there are changes landed in  git_main and Pixel devices, could you please help to share the commits with me, so that I could check if it\u0027s possible to do the same changes on the db845c configurations, instead of reverting this commit on our side?",
